{"text": " Te treze\u0219ti \u00een anul 1500 \u00een trun\u021ba din flandra. Cuptorul de p\u00e2ine Cald, iar buc\u0103teria miroasea secar\u0103 \u0219i afum, \u0219tiai c\u0103 aici, \u00een p\u00e2n\u0103 la 4 zile din zece, e interzit s\u0103 man\u0103\u0219i carne. Vinerea, postul mare, postul cr\u0103ciunului, biserica le spune zile de post. 8 cea \u00een farfurie, p\u00e2inea proape la fiecare mas\u0103, terci maz\u0103re \u0219i fasole, bere de b\u0103ut, pe\u0219te uscat \u00een zilele de post. Cea mai mare parte din ce cheltu e familia ta se duce pe m\u00e2ncare? 7 zici p\u00e2n\u0103 la 80 la suta. C\u00e2nd recolta nu este, p\u00e2inea se scum pe\u0219te brusc, iar oamenii fl\u0103m\u00e2nt zezc. C\u00e2t treie\u0219ti, \u00een anglie chiar pe este mare, un nou n\u0103scut putea spera la vr\u0103 30 \u0219i 5 de ani, mai ales pentru c\u0103 mureau foarte m\u00e2scopii. Dac\u0103 apucai 30 de ani, aveai \u0219anse de stul de bune s\u0103 ajunge la 60. Deci ce e m\u00e2ncarea pentru tine? Combustibil. C\u00e2t s\u0103 supravie\u021bi o ie\u0219ti ziua. Sine minte zilele de post, revin la final. Iar pe mare \u00een cele mai lungi calatorii, marinarii \u00eencep s\u0103 se destrame.", "segments": [{"id": 0, "seek": 0, "start": 0.0, "end": 3.72, "text": " Te treze\u0219ti \u00een anul 1500 \u00een trun\u021ba din flandra.", "tokens": [50364, 1989, 2192, 1381, 10355, 7317, 15351, 364, 425, 2119, 628, 15351, 504, 409, 15918, 64, 3791, 932, 474, 424, 13, 50564], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.4500850584448838, "compression_ratio": 1.4817813765182186, "no_speech_prob": 0.061533939093351364, "words": [{"word": " Te", "start": 0.0, "end": 0.2, "probability": 0.27673912048339844}, {"word": " treze\u0219ti", "start": 0.2, "end": 0.72, "probability": 0.7885619550943375}, {"word": " \u00een", "start": 0.72, "end": 0.88, "probability": 0.4932715892791748}, {"word": " anul", "start": 0.88, "end": 1.16, "probability": 0.9183696508407593}, {"word": " 1500", "start